@UniversalProjectManager.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5193

# Run a project idea through the full agent pipeline.
# The action binds the whole body to a string, so send a JSON string (in quotes), not an object.
# The request stays open until every orchestration cycle finishes, which can take a minute or more.
POST {{UniversalProjectManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/project/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

"Build a C# console app that tracks daily water intake and warns when I fall below 2 liters"

###

# An empty goal is rejected with 400 Bad Request before any model call is made.
POST {{UniversalProjectManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/project/generate
Content-Type: application/json

""

###
